SUMMARY:Toronto Islands Sunset Stroll. Dog friendly
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\nNOTE - 
 it often faster to [buy your ferry ticket online in advance](https://secur
 e.toronto.ca/FerryTicketOnline/tickets2/index.jsp)\n\nEnd your week with s
 ome surf\, sand\, and fun.\n\nI love to show off this magical place to bot
 h longtime visitors and people discovering them for the first time too. Th
 e Toronto Islands are one of my favourite spots in all of the city for a m
 ultitude of reasons.\n\nLong to learn more about the rich history of the T
 oronto Islands? Participants will spot some amazing houses\, creep by a ha
 unted lighthouse\, walk on a rainbow\, see a giant hedge maze\, and more.\
 n\nThis is a dog friendly walk . So leashed\, well-behaved dogs are welcom
 e.\n\nWe will take the 6:45PM ferry to Hanlan's Point. All participants ar
 e responsible for their ferry fares. We will walk from Hanlan's Point to W
 ard's Island with some brief stops along the way.\n\nWe will return on the
  9:45PM ferry from Ward's Island.\n\nWhile paths are all lit\, participant
 s may want to bring headlights/flashlights for improved visibility.\n\nUpo
 n arrival\, pay your ferry fare and then look for me in the waiting area. 
 I'll be holding a Meetup sign.\n\nI may even borrow a dog or two for this 
 adventure.\n\n**NOTE** \\- remember that you can just show up if unsure of
  your schedule
